resources.string:
Under “Other tools” you can:
• sign up to 16 files at once with your certificate;
• create and check file hashes;
• protect a file for specific people or with a key, and open it later;
• check Veri*Factu records, read the tax QR code and check it with the AEAT;
• create and check ENI documents;
• create an ENI file with the documents in a folder and sign its index.

In the advanced signing options you can also choose the XMLdSig, ODF, OOXML, FacturaE, ASiC-XAdES or Veri*Factu record formats.
